vwFiIful&_nc_oc=AdldovVRDYYu9rFZiQ9YFXDJIPz0_5Xpv7uNpxT8oF9yMyCO_EPcAg9nCuxoXXUBszc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftfegQELXEn1wfOqIoJnVVgivUShUWoTQJPCVsTNtG9lA&oe=69A57C2E"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175727.png", "id": "1630611974467428", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75411988_1630611977800761_7635821973011666471_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dTF6LoR_WwUQ7kNvwEj3KaL&_nc_oc=Adl563qcKuL484oP4eEZg7LM2_mdnZPDHIJos-HFu4qmLGmtOVpG5NXo3hqwN3xdleo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvHTvsQ498e_QAZLqEM_urFV7Ad2wokcYIbn9UDNYCm5Q&oe=69A56DAE"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175713.png", "id": "549067324527740", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210389_549067327861073_2529266429934636058_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MMI1ar542y4Q7kNvwFtZ-Cw&_nc_oc=AdkSwK4uOJxUN6B791kvs9bi39CZJh1vN2v1Hue0M6bd-S-NuKMx2kz-oxG1I0Q92sA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftGfheap37uMse6ugg_4wP3lMfUk_mjebW_Yx1ah0MJBA&oe=69A5897B"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175750.png", "id": "1233285141120740", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974456_1233285144454073_4577451540501517425_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mj9UQvI-QZoQ7kNvwERixDl&_nc_oc=AdlSm6d38DCYqRXe8kGB151OKjiZK8yWgEsLiRtHIe2sTl0rGlr5mW4WavBNHhibOtc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuxhDwg4qQmk9Z4zz5R4gz3wwhLJ_1pYeU7x-E2WBj0Iw&oe=69A58F0F"}, {"file_name": "com.WellsStudios.WellsTaggers-20241101-175810 (1).png", "id": "1549630812590254", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984460_1549630815923587_3757692530628789073_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S4xryadNOnwQ7kNvwGn_0Ja&_nc_oc=Adklw-6cyD4HN-TngQaiRIfNCtTX5HjMvSA8971SpUrBGcxfI0eB2xg-VT3MQGp3I3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftGW1nH88TI4VRpRabAeaILyJVXEekRs0iNLbDhGHjmSQ&oe=69A58723"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wells Taggers", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer runs out. Runners must avoid being tagged and use the environment and power-ups to outmaneuver the Taggers.\n\nGame Modes:\n\nClassic Tag: Traditional tag mode where Taggers must tag all Runners to win.\nInfected Tag: Tagged players become Taggers, spreading the infection until only one Runner remains.\nFreeze Tag: Tagged players are frozen in place until a teammate unfreezes them. Taggers win by freezing all players.\nMaps:\n\nUrban Playground: Navigate through a bustling cityscape with rooftops, alleys, and parks.\nEnchanted Forest: A magical forest filled with hiding spots and mystical creatures.\nSpace Station: A futuristic environment with zero-gravity zones and space-themed obstacles.\nPower-Ups:\n\n\n", "short_description": "Overview\nWells Taggers is an exhilarating, fast-paced multiplayer game where players engage in the classic playground game of tag within a vibrant, interactive Roblox world. Inspired by the timeless fun of \"Gorilla Tag,\" this game takes the simple concept of tag and elevates it with dynamic environments, diverse characters, and unique abilities.\n\nGameplay\nObjective:\nPlayers are divided into two teams: Taggers and Runners. The Taggers' goal is to chase and tag all the Runners before the timer."}]}, "developer_name": "Wells_VR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://si